ATTRACT MODE -- THE PINS
Part 01, section 1.8. One file, both PCs. Never "latest".
Only the EXPERT changes a pin, and writes the reason beside it.

HOW TO READ A LINE: the name, then two or more spaces, then the value, then
two or more spaces and the reason. A value of OPEN means nobody has pinned it
yet. A name that says a PC applies to that PC only, because the two Linux
systems bring different PHP. "am doctor" reads this shape, so the shapes must
not be broken.

